{"t":"Temple Teleport","s":"temple-teleport-b485c","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Temple_Teleport_671746.png","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Temple Teleport</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"Temple Teleport\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Temple_Teleport_671746.png\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.82<br/>September 30, 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\nA <b>Temple Teleport</b> will bring a character instantly to the temple of his hometown. It can be bought on the Store for 15 <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tibia Coins\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tibia_Coins_Small_f363f5.gif\" width=\"12\"/></span> Tibia Coins.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The temple teleport cannot be used while having a battle sign, a protection zone block or if the character is on a non-logout zone. It also doesn't work if the character is close to his/hers home temple. \n</p><p>Premium players can also receive a temporary <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20Teleport%20Scroll\">Temple Teleport Scroll</a> from the Daily Reward System once per week. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Before the 12.08.8034 patch, it used to cost 55 <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tibia Coins\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tibia_Coins_Small_f363f5.gif\" width=\"12\"/></span>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p>Store</p></div></div>","quests":["heart-of-destruction-quest","illuminated-warrior-outfits-quest"]}